  "problem": "Given that ${lim}_{x\\to \\,1}Cf(x)=8,$ where $C$ is a real constant, what is the value of $C?$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $C=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "From the graph, we see ${lim}_{x\\to \\,1}f(x)=-1.$\n\nWe factor the constant out of the limit and evaluate the remaining limit, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 1}Cf(x) & =8 \\\\ C\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to 1}f(x) & =8 \\\\ C\\cdot (-1) & =8 \\\\ C & =-8\\end{aligned}\n$$",
